        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Computational Photography",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DUAL NATIVE ISO:\n    Camera has two distinct gain paths (Sony A7S III: ISO100 + ISO640/1280)\n    Each native ISO has its own low noise floor\n    → In video: alternating frame ISO → HDR video (HDR HLG)\n```"
    },
