        "title": "Computational Photography",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Drago (2003) — logarithmic:\n    L_d = (L_dmax × 0.01 / log₁₀(Lmax + 1)) × log₁₀(L + 1) × (bias function)\n    Bias: user-controlled compression of dark vs. bright regions\n    Visual: preserves local contrast well; can appear slightly washed out"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md#021",
      "path": [
        "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md"
      ],
