        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Gamma compression: L_d = L_w^(1/γ), γ typically 2.2\n    Simplest; used in cameras; maps linear sensor to gamma-encoded display\n    Not a true HDR tone mapper — just gamma encoding"
    },
    {
