      "text": "LOCAL TONE MAPPING OPERATORS:\n  Key insight: human visual system adapts locally (eye adapts dark and bright simultaneously)\n  Local operators: compute spatially-varying tone mapping — each region mapped differently"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md#023",
      "path": [
