      "text": "## Focus Stacking"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md#028",
      "path": [
        "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
