      },
      "text": "```\nFOCUS STACKING PURPOSE:\n  Single exposure: plane of sharp focus is a thin slice through 3D scene\n  Focus stacking: multiple exposures, each focused at different depth\n    → Merge: keep sharpest region from each exposure → extended DoF throughout"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md#029",
      "path": [
        "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:photography:08-computational-photography, git-history:photography:08-computational-photography]",
        "canonical_path": "photography/08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md",
