        "section": "photography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Computational Photography",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DEPTH-FROM-FOCUS CUES:\n  Sharpness metric: how focused is each pixel in each frame?\n  Laplacian (second derivative of intensity): high → sharp; low → blurry\n  Gradient magnitude: local contrast measure\n  Tenengrad: sum of squared Sobel filter responses\n  DCT frequency content: high spatial frequencies → sharpness\n  → For each pixel: find frame with highest sharpness metric → select that frame's value"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md#031",
      "path": [
        "08-COMPUTATIONAL-PHOTOGRAPHY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:photography:08-computational-photography, git-history:photography:08-computational-photography]",
